        "category": "class",
        "description": {
            "value": "<p>Your bond with your Cloth has deepened past armor into a second body. Its runes, its history, and your cosmo have become one thing, and it answers your intent before your mind forms it.</p><p>Choose <strong>two</strong> benefits from the list below; you gain both. You may retrain to swap one whenever you gain a level.</p><ul><li><strong>Reactive Cloth</strong> &mdash; your Cloth's AC bonus applies even in the brief instants surprise would deny it to you, and you are never off-guard during the first round of combat while wearing it.</li><li><strong>Runic Echo</strong> &mdash; the property runes on your Cloth also apply to one Technique of your choice, as <em>Cloth Bond</em> but for property runes. If you have <em>Cloth Bond</em>, it now covers a second Technique as well.</li><li><strong>Self-Mending</strong> &mdash; when your Cloth would crack, it does not; instead you gain temporary Hit Points equal to your level. Once per encounter.</li><li><strong>Cosmo Conduit</strong> &mdash; once per day, when you Refocus, you regain <strong>2 Focus Points</strong> instead of 1.</li></ul><hr /><p><strong>Special</strong> On any day your Cloth's constellation is ascendant, you gain the benefit of <strong>all four</strong> options for that day.</p>"
        },
